    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282490/extras/c9f5aa20b525020b9bb69dfa616f9c1b.avif?t=1751522307\" width=800 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Kingdom Saga</strong> is a character-driven fantasy visual novel that follows a kingdom of knights defeated in a long war, now taking its first steps toward hope and recovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can experience <strong>Chapter 0: The Princess\u2019s Escape</strong> and <strong>Chapter 1: Shadows in Motion</strong>, fully remade from the original voice drama with immersive direction, UI, and gameplay enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through expressive character portraits, atmospheric backgrounds, and an evocative soundtrack, relive the tense nights and emotional struggles as the story unfolds before your eyes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282490/extras/c9f5aa20b525020b9bb69dfa616f9c1b.avif?t=1751522307\" width=800 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Kingdom Saga</strong> is a character-driven fantasy visual novel that follows a kingdom of knights defeated in a long war, now taking its first steps toward hope and recovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can experience <strong>Chapter 0: The Princess\u2019s Escape</strong> and <strong>Chapter 1: Shadows in Motion</strong>, fully remade from the original voice drama with immersive direction, UI, and gameplay enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through expressive character portraits, atmospheric backgrounds, and an evocative soundtrack, relive the tense nights and emotional struggles as the story unfolds before your eyes.</p>",
    "short_description": "A dramatic visual novel about a fallen kingdom, where a young princess and her allies begin a journey to reclaim hope from the ruins of war.",
